# G6.3 (2026-08-26): Postgres image scan exemptions, each with rationale.
# Review every exemption when the image digest is next upgraded (see
# deploy/compose.yaml) — drop the entries that no longer apply.
#
# OpenSSL QUIC-server memory-growth DoS (libcrypto3/libssl3 3.5.7-r0,
# fixed 3.5.8-r0): Postgres serves TCP TLS, never QUIC, so the vulnerable
# code path is not reachable. Re-evaluate if the deployment ever fronts
# QUIC-terminating TLS.
CVE-2026-14456
#
# golang toolchain local-DoS inside the alpine image (net/url, crypto/tls):
# bundled tooling, not part of the postgres server attack surface.
CVE-2026-56859
CVE-2026-56860
CVE-2026-56862
